BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-wed-run@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260820T070000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260820T073000
SUMMARY:🟢 Easy run — 6 km
URL:https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w1-wed
DESCRIPTION:Pace: 6:45–7:15 /km\n\nFirst run at the correct easy pace — deliberately slower than feels natural. Flat route. Check average pace on Strava after: aim for 6:45–7:20.\n\n▸ Full session details: https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w1-wed\n\nBEFORE RUN (10 min):\n• Clamshells 3×15 each side\n• Side-lying hip abduction 3×15 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge 3×12 each side\n• Hip flexor stretch 60 sec each side\n• TFL foam roll 60 sec each side\n\nEVENING (15 min):\n• Monster walks 3×15 steps\n• Step-downs 3×12 each side\n• IT band stretch 3×45 sec each side\n• Pigeon pose 90 sec each side\n• Lateral band walks 3×20 steps\n• Single-leg calf raises 3×15 each side
CATEGORIES:Run,Easy
END:VEVENT

