CATEGORIES:Physio
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-sat-long@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260822T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260822T091500
SUMMARY:🔵 Long run — 10 km
URL:https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w1-sat
DESCRIPTION:Pace: 7:00–7:30 /km\n\nEasy and controlled throughout. Walk 1 min at km 5 as a planned break. If the left knee gives any sensation\, slow to 7:45. Ice the knee after.\n\n▸ Full session details: https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w1-sat\n\nBEFORE RUN (10 min):\n• Clamshells 3×15 each side\n• Side-lying hip abduction 3×15 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge 3×12 each side\n• Hip flexor stretch 60 sec each side\n• TFL foam roll 60 sec each side
CATEGORIES:Run,Long
END:VEVENT

