BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w9-race@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261025T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261025T124500
SUMMARY:🏅 MARATHON — 25 Oct 2026
URL:https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w9-race
DESCRIPTION:TARGET: 4:30 (6:24 /km)\n\n▸ Full race day strategy: https://jamatter.github.io/marathon.html#w9-race\n\nRACE MORNING:\n−3h: Familiar breakfast (oats\, banana\, coffee)\n−60 min: Full IT band physio — non-negotiable\n−20 min: Easy 5 min jog + dynamic leg swings\n\nPACING:\nkm 0–5:   6:35–6:45 /km — deliberately slow\nkm 5–20:  6:20–6:30 /km — settle in\nkm 20–30: 6:20–6:30 /km — hold form\, walk 90 sec every 5 km\nkm 30–35: 6:30–7:00 /km — IT band danger zone\nkm 35–42: Run on feel\, walk downhills\n\nIbuprofen at km 30 with a gel if using it.
CATEGORIES:Race
END:VEVENT

END:VCALENDAR
